          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "A concise list of selected references is included at the end of each chapter. These are arranged in alphabetical order by author surname under the main chapter section headings. These references often include the original papers in which the most critical discoveries were first reported. The ebook also includes the DOI identifier for the references, making it easy for students to access the articles."
